Towing industry founder Ernest Holmes Sr. began his career as an interior decorator

153
00:12:46,941 --> 00:12:50,140
at a local department store, selling curtains and drapes.

154
00:12:50,141 --> 00:12:53,140
Towing will return on Modern Marvels.

