Welcome to the Tow Times Western Regional Tow Show in Reno, Nevada.

156
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:07,060
Excuse me.

157
00:13:07,540 --> 00:13:08,660
Quite a few years ago.

158
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:14,580
If you're in the market for a brand new wrecker or just want to spruce up your old one with some flashy accessories,

159
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:17,040
you've come to the right place.

160
00:13:17,041 --> 00:13:22,040
This is one of the Cadillacs of the towing bar.

161
00:13:22,041 --> 00:13:23,840
This is next to indestructible.

162
00:13:23,841 --> 00:13:28,940
You can take this, throw it on the floor, it's not going to hurt it.

163
00:13:28,941 --> 00:13:31,940
By using air cushions, you spread the load over a wide area,

164
00:13:31,941 --> 00:13:36,340
not causing structural deficiency to the trailer.

165
00:13:36,341 --> 00:13:44,540
The purpose behind the ice light is so it can be used as a safety device for the individual drivers as they exit the vehicle.

166
00:13:44,541 --> 00:13:51,180
What's great about this truck is this truck is capable of handling a family that may be stranded on the road.

167
00:13:51,181 --> 00:14:00,620
What this truck provides is the opportunity for the tow operator to pull the car up and then also get the family comfortably in the truck.

168
